<view class="page"><view class="brand">LIVERSE<text class="orange">.</text></view><view class="title">{{name}}</view><view class="muted">记录每一次与现场的相遇</view><button wx:if="{{!loggedIn}}" class="primary" bindtap="login">微信登录</button><input wx:else type="nickname" value="{{name}}" placeholder="设置公开昵称" bindblur="profile"/><view class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="row"><view class="grow line" data-url="/pages/records/index?type=favorites" bindtap="open"><view class="metric">{{favorites}}</view><view class="muted">本机收藏</view></view><view class="grow line" data-url="/pages/records/index?type=recent" bindtap="open"><view class="metric">{{recent}}</view><view class="muted">最近浏览</view></view></view><view class="line" data-url="/pages/records/index?type=cloud" bindtap="open">云端收藏 →</view><view class="line" data-url="/pages/records/index?type=contributions" bindtap="open">我的投稿 →</view><view class="line" data-url="/pages/tickets/index" bindtap="open">反馈与举报进度 →</view><view class="line" data-url="/pages/privacy/index" bindtap="open">隐私与数据管理 →</view><button wx:if="{{loggedIn}}" bindtap="logout">退出登录</button><view class="muted section">本机收藏仅保存在此设备；清理小程序缓存后可能丢失。查看和收藏均不占座。</view></view>
